2026-10-26 16:18:14,103 | INFO | TestCase 9: Source [ORACLE]:WITH rollover_excluded_mbrs AS (

  SELECT 
  DISTINCT mp.mbi,
  mp.member_profile_id_nh,
  mp.business_id_nh 
